,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98301","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98301.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98301.patch","merged_at":"2024-10-30T00:28:36Z"},"body":"Updated `GDScriptInstance::validate_property` to only convert `PropertyInfo` to `Dictionary` if `_validate_property` function is found.\r\n\r\nThis can make `Node.duplicate` around 4-5x faster for nodes that have gdscript attached, when the script doesn't override `_validate_property`.  Compared with scripts below:\r\n\r\nTestClass:\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name TestClass extends Node2D\r\n\r\nvar a\r\nvar b\r\nvar c\r\nvar d\r\n\r\n#func _validate_property(property: Dictionary) -> void:\r\n#\tpass\r\n```\r\n\r\nMain Scene:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tvar node := TestClass.new()\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in 1000:\r\n\t\tadd_child(node.duplicate())\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%dms\" % (end - start))\r\n```\r\n\r\nOld:\r\n```\r\n139ms\r\n238ms (_validate_property uncommented)\r\n```\r\n\r\nNew:\r\n```\r\n28ms\r\n239ms (_validate_property uncommented)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98301/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":6,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98301/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}